CORE
SymbolicTrim
--function SymbolicTrim.check --unwind 6 --max-nondet-string-length 6 --cp `../../../../scripts/format_classpath.sh . ../../../lib/java-models-library/target/core-models.jar ../../../lib/java-models-library/target/cprover-api.jar`
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
--
Trim of a nondet string of length <= 4 is compared with a reference
computed character by character, so the string solver's trim axioms are
exercised (unlike the constant-folded tests in this directory).
